    "Anas Auth is free software: you can use, modify and redistribute it under the terms of the GNU Affero General Public License version 3 (AGPL-3.0). It comes with no warranty; see the license for details. This project is not affiliated with ente.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Anas Auth 是自由软件：你可以依据 GNU Affero 通用公共许可证第 3 版（AGPL-3.0）的条款使用、修改和再分发它。本程序不提供任何担保，详见许可证全文。本项目与 ente 无隶属关系。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Anas Auth 是自由軟體：你可以依據 GNU Affero 通用公共授權條款第 3 版（AGPL-3.0）的條款使用、修改和再分發它。本程式不提供任何擔保，詳見授權條款全文。本專案與 ente 無隸屬關係。"
          }
        }
