    "Delete %@? If this is your only way to sign in, you may lose access to the account. This can’t be undone.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "确定删除 %@？如果这是唯一的验证凭证，删除后可能无法登录该服务。此操作无法撤销。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "確定刪除 %@？如果這是唯一的驗證憑證，刪除後可能無法登入該服務。此動作無法復原。"
          }
        }
      }
